  "sections": [
    {
      "selector": "#answers",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 472,
      "y": 394,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 706,
      "heading": "STAR Breakdown",
      "backgroundColor": "#020618",
      "callsToAction": [
        "See feedback"
      ],
      "text": "STAR Breakdown Domain: Strategic Influence Tell me about a time you influenced a team to adopt a new process without having direct authority. S T A R Strong See feedback Excellent use of the STAR framework. The situation was clear, the action steps were specific, and the result included measurable impact. Domain: Cross Functional Leadership Describe a situation where you had to coordinate across multiple departments to deliver a project. S T A R Adequate See feedback Good setup and actions, but the result lacked specific metrics. Consider quantifying the project outcome next time. Domain: Conf",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#dimensions",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 472,
      "y": 1380,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 1096,
      "heading": "Skill Breakdown",
      "backgroundColor": "#020618",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Skill Breakdown"
      ],
      "text": "Skill Breakdown Communication Leadership Problem Solving Collaboration Adaptability Communication 8/10 Observation: Used clear, structured language throughout Reasoning: Maintained logical flow across all three answers without losing the interviewer Observation: Adapted vocabulary for a non-technical audience Reasoning: Showed awareness of the interviewer context when describing system changes Leadership 7/10 Observation: Described delegating work and aligning stakeholders Reasoning: Demonstrated ownership of the outcome while enabling the team Problem Solving 8/10 Observation: Broke down a co",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#patterns",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 472,
      "y": 2508,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 361,
      "heading": "Performance Patterns",
      "backgroundColor": "#020618",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "Performance Patterns Repeated behaviors observed across your answers. Strengths Consistently opens with strong situation framing that gives the interviewer context quickly high impact Uses specific actions rather than vague descriptions of what the team did medium impact Gaps Results section often lacks quantified business impact high impact Tends to under-credit team contributions, which may signal low collaboration awareness medium impact",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#strengths",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 472,
      "y": 2901,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 677,
      "heading": "Strengths",
      "backgroundColor": "#020618",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "Strengths Communication: Clear, well-structured responses that are easy to follow Problem Solving: Demonstrates systematic thinking and prioritisation under pressure Leadership: Takes ownership of outcomes and drives initiatives forward Areas for Improvement Collaboration: High priority Credit team members more explicitly and describe your role within the team dynamic Better approach Instead of \"I implemented the solution\", try \"I proposed the approach and paired with our senior backend engineer to implement it, while our designer ran user testing in parallel.\" Results: High priority Always cl",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#cv-alignment",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 472,
      "y": 3610,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 413,
      "heading": "CV-Interview Alignment",
      "backgroundColor": "#020618",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Led cross-functional team of 12 to deliver platform migratio",
        "Improved system performance by 40% through code-splitting an",
        "Mentored 5 junior engineers, with 3 promoted within 18 month"
      ],
      "text": "CV-Interview Alignment How your interview evidence supports your CV claims. Consistent Understated Overstated Mixed Your interview answers generally undersold your experience. Your CV claims strong leadership and strategic impact, but your answers focused more on execution details than strategic thinking. Led cross-functional team of 12 to deliver platform migration on time and under budget Understated Interview evidence Described coordinating across departments but focused on individual contributions rather than leadership of 12 people Gap Your answer made this sound like a coordination role ",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#next-steps",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 472,
      "y": 4055,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 372,
      "heading": "Next Steps",
      "backgroundColor": "#020618",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "Next Steps 1 Quantify Results For each STAR story in your bank, write down 2-3 specific metrics that demonstrate business impact. 2 Team Framing Revisit your top 5 stories and add at least one sentence crediting a specific team member or cross-functional partner. 3 CV Alignment For each CV bullet point, prepare a matching STAR story that demonstrates the same level of scope and ownership.",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#replay",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 472,
      "y": 4459,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 594,
      "heading": "Transcript Replay",
      "backgroundColor": "#020618",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Audio unavailable",
        "0:02",
        "0:08",
        "0:45",
        "0:52",
        "1:30",
        "1:35"
      ],
      "text": "Transcript Replay Play from any sentence to review specific answers quickly. Audio unavailable INTERVIEWER #1 0:02 Tell me about a time you influenced a team to adopt a new process without having direct authority. YOU #2 0:08 Sure. Last year, our deploy process was manual and error-prone. I proposed we adopt CI/CD... INTERVIEWER #3 0:45 What was the biggest resistance you faced? YOU #4 0:52 The senior engineers were comfortable with the existing flow. I built a small proof-of-concept over a weekend... INTERVIEWER #5 1:30 How did that turn out? YOU #6 1:35 Within a month, the whole team adopted",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    }
